@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
allowmixing
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
title Bibliographic startup configuration - implemented elements
component "Spring Environment\nexternal properties and overrides" as Properties
class BibliographicConfiguration
class SourceSelection
class SourceRegistration
class BibliographicService
interface BibliographicSource
class GoogleBooksAdapter
class OpenLibraryAdapter
Properties --> BibliographicConfiguration : configured identifiers
BibliographicConfiguration --> SourceSelection : select(identifiers, registrations)
SourceSelection --> SourceRegistration : build temporary map / resolve IDs
SourceRegistration --> BibliographicSource : registered implementation
BibliographicConfiguration --> BibliographicService : inject selected ordered collection
BibliographicService --> BibliographicSource : lookup on enabled sources
GoogleBooksAdapter ..|> BibliographicSource
OpenLibraryAdapter ..|> BibliographicSource
note bottom of SourceSelection : Registry is a local map, not a standalone registry class.
@enduml
